    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n84077" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πνῑγ-μός</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>choking, suffocation,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Coac.</u>
				61
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				514a6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PA</u>
				664b31
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				Anaxandr.
				33.8
			</span></i>; of weeds, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρέχει π. αὐτῷ [τῷ
